title: 'Geometry Development with DD4hep (ePIC tutorial)'
message: >-
  Please cite this lesson using the information in this file
  when you refer to it in publications, and/or if you
  re-use, adapt, or expand on the content in your own
  training material.
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Simon
    family-names: Gardner
  - name: The ePIC Collaboration
abstract: >-
  An ePIC tutorial on developing detector geometry with the DD4hep toolkit: locating the ePIC
  geometry inside eic-shell, understanding the structure of a compact geometry description,
  viewing the geometry, and modifying or adding to it by writing detector plugins. Built with
  The Carpentries Workbench.
keywords:
  - EIC
  - ePIC
  - DD4hep
  - geometry
  - detector description
  - Geant4
  - ROOT
